{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfKeFx4om7Ezv5iCeHtQ3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NtFcxkcNpWFHUuYYa9fXDj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -rf best_final_0.28825 && cp -r /workspace/candidate/checkpoint best_0.28955 && du -sh best_0.28955 && diff <(cd /workspace/candidate/checkpoint && find . -type f|sort) <(cd best_0.28955 && find . -type f|sort) && echo \"archived\"\ncat >> runs.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Serving the members with the option key restored (+0.0013)\n\nThe two members were trained with Choice options rendered as the description alone (`desc`).\nServing them with the key restored (`key: description`, the upstream rendering) — a deliberate\ntrain/serve mismatch — is better:\n\n| serving rendering | dev | **Judge** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `desc` (what they were trained on) | 0.2904 | 0.28825 |\n| **`key: desc`** | **0.2924** | **0.28955** |\n\nDevelopment predicted the direction and roughly the size (+0.0020 against +0.0013), and the\nper-source profile was clean: no regression on the worst source, gains concentrated where the\ncriteria keys carry information.\n\nThe two splits disagree about *where* the gain comes from, which is worth noting. On development\nit is mmlu (-0.023) and sciq (-0.032), whose criteria keys are the positional letters a/b/c/d —\nrepeating the letter inside the option text reinforces exactly the channel the head reads. On the\nhidden set mmlu is flat and the gain is **fresh_routing (-0.075)** and sciq (-0.020), where the\nkeys are presumably meaningful names. Both are the same underlying effect: the key is a short,\noption-unique token, and the head's lexical view reads precisely the first token [REDACTED] each option.\n\nTraining *and* serving with `key: desc` is worse than either (0.28815, agent-9), so this is not\nsimply \"the upstream rendering was right\". The asymmetry is real: train on the description so the\nhead must learn content, then hand it the key for free at inference.\nEOF\necho recorded","description":"Archive the new best and document the finding","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":959,"cache_read_input_tokens":673450,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":959},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5e37b52e-1e5b-4ee1-bd03-e7d0043bc94c","uuid":"e0481bba-e250-4fb7-a765-2f72465ee19c","request_id":"req_011CfKeFwWpBunjDgP4xzkF1"}
